.mdx","Organiza los dispositivos y sus identidades, prepara el enrolamiento e integra consumidores.",{"_124":382},"platform/iot-fleets/overview.mdx",{"_107":108,"_102":384,"_109":-7,"_110":-7,"_111":-7,"_113":-7,"_104":385,"_100":499,"_122":500,"_120":502},"<span><span>Actualizaciones</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-[3px] bg-[var(--lm-badge-bg)] px-1.5 py-px text-[0.58rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-white ml-2 align-middle\">Enterprise</span></span>",[386,391,393,398,400,405,410,415,420,425,430,433,438,443,448,453,458,461,466,471,476,479,484,489,494],{"_100":387,"_107":117,"_102":74,"_111":388,"_120":-7,"_13":73,"_122":389},"es:platform/updates/overview.mdx","Qué hace el servicio, cómo encaja con Lamassu IoT, WFX y hawkBit, y por dónde empezar.",{"_124":390},"platform/updates/overview.mdx",{"_100":392,"_107":144,"_120":-7,"_102":19},"es:_7",{"_100":394,"_107":117,"_102":47,"_111":395,"_120":-7,"_13":46,"_122":396},"es:platform/updates/getting-started.mdx","Ejecuta Lamassu Updates y sus dependencias en local con Docker Compose y comprueba que la API responde.",{"_124":397},"platform/updates/getting-started.mdx",{"_100":399,"_107":144,"_120":-7,"_102":38},"es:_8",{"_100":401,"_107":117,"_102":38,"_111":402,"_120":-7,"_13":37,"_122":403},"es:platform/updates/concepts.mdx","Paquetes de actualización, módulos de software, campañas de lanzamiento, workflows y cómo llega una actualización a un dispositivo.",{"_124":404},"platform/updates/concepts.mdx",{"_100":406,"_107":117,"_102":34,"_111":407,"_120":-7,"_13":33,"_122":408},"es:platform/updates/architecture.mdx","Los componentes de Lamassu Updates, cómo se conectan en cada backend y qué se ejecuta en segundo plano.",{"_124":409},"platform/updates/architecture.mdx",{"_100":411,"_107":117,"_102":44,"_111":412,"_120":-7,"_13":43,"_122":413},"es:platform/updates/flows.mdx","Diagramas de secuencia de las operaciones importantes, para los backends nativo y hawkBit.",{"_124":414},"platfor